Fire a beam of energy that rakes across the ground, dealing [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage to enemies within and leaving behind an unstable rift. After 3 turns the rift detonates, dealing [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage to adjacent enemies.

Targets cannot be struck by more than a single rift explosion at once.

The power of this spell inflicts entropic backlash on you, causing you to take [71, 96, 115, 132, 146 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage over 8 turns. This damage counts as entropy for the purpose of Entropic Gift.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
